<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Beverly Enterprises.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Beverly Enterprises.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said it upgraded Beverly Enterprises to buy from &quot;long-term buy.&quot;</p>
<p>-- raised the 12-month price target on the stock to $18 from $16.</p>
<p>-- Morgan said its earnings estimates of $0.18 a share for the first quarter and $0.88 a share for the full year &quot;could prove to be conservative if the recent operating trends continue.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Beverly Enterprises was up 3/8 to 14.</p>
</text>
